WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.160 --> 00:00:04.752
Ask it like you'd ask a person.

2
00:00:04.920 --> 00:00:12.908
It doesn't just answer. It goes and does it.

3
00:00:13.120 --> 00:00:22.408
Your apps, one assistant.

4
